            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "yes, I know how the option works.\n\nif I `set nocursorline`, mini.files overrides that and shows the cursor line anyway, why not when I change the option?\n\nI don't want the cursor line in my text editing buffers, but I do want it in mini.files.\n\nI already done an override in my config, but if the intended behavior is to respect the global setting you still have a bug.",
