            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> if I `set nocursorline`, mini.files overrides that and shows the cursor line anyway, why not when I change the option?\n\nMentioning *that* in the issue would have been helpful. I did not remember that 'mini.files' forces cursor line (which is reasonable, as the local to explorer `MiniFilesCursorline` highlight group can be cleared to disable showing cursor line).\n\nShould now be fixed on latest main.",
